### Stage 1 demo (B1.13). Run the dev server (`npm run dev`), seed the dev accounts
### (`npm run seed:dev`), sign in as each dev account in the browser, then send these
### with the session cookie. The same walk-through runs automatically in
### tests/stage1ExitGate.test.ts. Replace {{org}} with the organisation slug.

@base = http://localhost:3000
@org = figbloom

### 1. The shell: one call, same shape for every role
GET {{base}}/api/me/context

### 2. Profile
PATCH {{base}}/api/orgs/{{org}}/me/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Wanjiru K.", "timeZone": "Africa/Nairobi" }

### 3. Preferences: change, reset, undo (use the token from the reset response)
PATCH {{base}}/api/orgs/{{org}}/me/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{ "theme": "OCEAN", "hourFormat": "H24", "startPage": "leads" }

###
POST {{base}}/api/orgs/{{org}}/me/preferences/reset

###
POST {{base}}/api/orgs/{{org}}/me/preferences/undo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "<undo.token from the reset response>" }

### 4. Notification settings
GET {{base}}/api/orgs/{{org}}/me/notification-preferences

###
PATCH {{base}}/api/orgs/{{org}}/me/notification-preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{ "preset": "IMPORTANT_ONLY", "quietHours": { "enabled": true, "start": "20:00", "end": "07:00" } }

### 5. Sessions: list devices, stay signed in, sign one device out, sign out all others
GET {{base}}/api/me/sessions

###
POST {{base}}/api/session/extend

###
DELETE {{base}}/api/me/sessions/<session id>

###
POST {{base}}/api/me/sessions/sign-out-others

###
GET {{base}}/api/me/sign-in-events

### 6. Organisation look: everyone reads, only Management writes (a 403 names the permission and who to ask)
GET {{base}}/api/orgs/{{org}}/look

###
PATCH {{base}}/api/orgs/{{org}}/look
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Figbloom Kenya", "defaultTheme": "SKY" }

### 7. Dev Platform Super Admin: sign in with the dev platform cookie (development only), then
GET {{base}}/api/me/context
